Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: recipe_list

    2 recipe_list: recipe_list recipe
    3            | recipe

    4 recipe: RECIPE IDENTIFIER LBRACE step_list RBRACE

    5 step_list: step_list step
    6          | step

    7 step: STEP INTEGER_LITERAL LBRACE stmt_list RBRACE

    8 stmt_list: stmt_list stmt
    9          | ε

   10 stmt: simple_stmt SEMICOLON
   11     | if_stmt
   12     | while_stmt
   13     | repeat_stmt
   14     | error SEMICOLON

   15 simple_stmt: get_stmt
   16            | add_stmt
   17            | cook_stmt
   18            | boil_stmt
   19            | drain_stmt
   20            | mix_stmt
   21            | serve_stmt
   22            | return_stmt
   23            | assignment

   24 get_stmt: GET IDENTIFIER

   25 add_stmt: ADD IDENTIFIER number unit TO IDENTIFIER
   26         | ADD IDENTIFIER TO IDENTIFIER

   27 cook_stmt: COOK IDENTIFIER IN IDENTIFIER number MIN_UNIT

   28 boil_stmt: BOIL IDENTIFIER IN IDENTIFIER number MIN_UNIT

   29 drain_stmt: DRAIN IDENTIFIER IDENTIFIER

   30 mix_stmt: MIX IDENTIFIER

   31 serve_stmt: SERVE IDENTIFIER

   32 return_stmt: RETURN IDENTIFIER

   33 assignment: SET IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   34 if_stmt: IF LPAREN condition RPAREN block

   35 while_stmt: WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN block

   36 repeat_stmt: REPEAT INTEGER_LITERAL TIMES block
   37            | REPEAT IDENTIFIER TIMES block

   38 block: LBRACE stmt_list RBRACE

   39 condition: expression EQ_OP expression
   40          | expression NE_OP expression
   41          | expression GT_OP expression
   42          | expression LT_OP expression
   43          | condition AND_OP condition
   44          | LPAREN condition RPAREN

   45 expression: expression ADD_OP term
   46           | expression SUB_OP term
   47           | term

   48 term: term MUL_OP factor
   49     | term DIV_OP factor
   50     | factor

   51 factor: INTEGER_LITERAL
   52       | FLOAT_LITERAL
   53       | IDENTIFIER
   54       | STRING_LITERAL
   55       | LPAREN expression RPAREN

   56 number: INTEGER_LITERAL
   57       | FLOAT_LITERAL

   58 unit: G_UNIT
   59     | L_UNIT
   60     | P_UNIT


